Package: astraea-all
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lwb89dev <lwb89dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: astraea-service (= @VERSION@), astraea-desktop (= @VERSION@)
Recommends: astraea-gnome-shell-extension (= @VERSION@)
Homepage: https://github.com/Lwb89dev/astraea
Description: Astraea — full desktop install (metapackage)
 Convenience metapackage: pulls in the background service and the desktop
 app, and recommends the GNOME Shell extension. Carries no files of its
 own — apt/dpkg installs the three real packages in dependency order from
 a single command (scripts/install-debs.sh).
 .
 KDE/COSMIC users who don't want the GNOME extension should install
 astraea-service and astraea-desktop directly instead of astraea-all.
